### Password for every user: Telecom@123
### alice=CUSTOMER(TN, owns 9876543210)  ravi=AGENT(TN)  sita=SUPERVISOR(TN)
### kiran=SUPERVISOR(KA, CONTRACTOR)     admin=ADMIN(ALL)

### Effective roles, permissions and attributes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/me
Authorization: Basic sita Telecom@123

### RBAC+ABAC: agent reads own-circle line -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscribers/9876543210
Authorization: Basic ravi Telecom@123

### ABAC: agent reads VIP line -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscribers/9876543211
Authorization: Basic ravi Telecom@123

### Content negotiation: full PII (supervisor+) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscribers/9876543211
Authorization: Basic sita Telecom@123
Accept: application/vnd.telecom.subscriber-full+json

### Refund within limit -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscribers/9876543210/refund
Authorization: Basic sita Telecom@123
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 500}

### CSV export from internal channel -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/subscribers
Authorization: Basic sita Telecom@123
Accept: text/csv
X-Channel: INTERNAL

### Dynamic RBAC: grant refund to AGENT
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/roles/AGENT/permissions/recharge:refund
Authorization: Basic admin Telecom@123

### Dynamic ABAC: set AGENT refund limit
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/policies/refund.limit.AGENT
Authorization: Basic admin Telecom@123
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": "200"}

### Dynamic ABAC: move ravi to Karnataka circle
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/ravi/attributes
Authorization: Basic admin Telecom@123
Content-Type: application/json

{"circle": "KA"}
